From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:31:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] shared: static system gesture feedback and back preview
 policy

Squashed from:
- 0012-static-system-gesture-feedback-and-back-preview-policy
- 0013-preserve-static-gesture-handle-parent-opacity

Change-Id: I9dc7d4dcfc8e882ddbb02d763aeb2be3d44f0066

With config_staticSystemGestures the gesture handle is an opaque black/white bar and SystemUI Back feedback is a fixed-position, discrete arrow (StaticBackGesture); config_predictiveBackAnimation false stops WindowManager from preparing system Back previews. Both default to the native behaviour.

